## Sidebar navigation (role + preset lens)

Built by [clinic-nav.ts](../../src/domain/nav/clinic-nav.ts) (`clinicNavCatalog`: rows carry kit conditions `permission` + `preset`, module sections carry `preset`) → [ClinicOpsShell.tsx](../../src/components/ClinicOpsShell.tsx) (one kit `useOpsNavProfile` read of `/api/auth/me`, re-read on `clinic-auth-refresh`; `visibleOpsNavItems` / `visibleOpsNavSections` paint once).

| Group | Visibility | Routes |
|-------|------------|--------|
| Flat top | all authenticated | `/` (Home — full-width; shared date toolbar; owners also get `ExecutiveDashboard`), `/patients` |
| Front desk | role + preset | `/appointments` (`outpatient` or `sanatorium_clinical`), `/reception/queue` and `/cashier` (`outpatient` only), `/reception/extra-tickets` (`sanatorium_clinical`) |
| Clinical | role + preset | `/doctor` (`outpatient`), `/nurse` and `/check-in` (`sanatorium_clinical`), `/lab-orders` (shared) |
| Reports | role + preset | `/reports/diagnoses` and `/reports/patients-by-country` (shared), `/reports/procedures` (`sanatorium_clinical`). Procedure report: a linked doctor is scoped to self; admin and nurse pick a doctor or see all |
| Sanatorium | preset `sanatorium_clinical` | `/sanatorium`, `/sanatorium/resources`, `/sanatorium/nurse-roster` |
| Inpatient | preset `inpatient_day` | `/inpatient`, `/inpatient/census`, `/admin/wards` |
| Wellness | preset `wellness` | placeholder (no routes yet — section auto-hides) |
| Catalogs | admin/owner | shared: `/admin/catalog`, `/admin/departments`, `/admin/diagnostic-catalog`, `/admin/icd-favorites`. Sanatorium only: `/admin/program-templates`, `/admin/lookups`, `/admin/physio-sites`, `/admin/import` |
| Rules & data | admin/owner | `/admin/procedure-rules` (`sanatorium_clinical`), `/admin/lis-profiles` and `/admin/master-data` (shared) |
| Platform | admin/owner | `/admin/audit`, `/admin/settings`. **Hesablar** submenu: `/admin/users` (role assignment), `/admin/access` (roles table; permission matrix in a modal), `/admin/logins` (login journal) |

Nafta appliance tenant `code=default` keeps preset `sanatorium_clinical` only (migration `20261001120000`). `clinic_inpatient` stays a sellable SKU and does not open the ward desk without `inpatient_day`.

Internal: `GET/POST /api/internal/v1/organization/bind` (orch Sync bindings; ADR satellite-organization-bind); `POST /api/internal/v1/procedure-validate`; `GET/POST /api/internal/v1/runtime-config` (incl. `clinicCutover` upsert). Cutover `#21` calls hotel `GET /api/internal/v1/stays/by-external-ref` then MDM `linkPersonIdentity`.

**SaaS Wave 2 request tenant:** staff `/api/auth/login` (+ optional `organizationId`) and SSO put org on JWT; middleware stamps `x-era-organization-id` from the token; `getSatelliteSession` takes the org from the token, gates `industry_clinic`, and loads grants; lifecycle/from-stay/settlement enter ALS from event/body org; ops stamps via `requestOrganizationId()`. Cron org list: kit `listCronOrganizationIds` (SHARED = orch pool registry with backoff, 503 when empty/unreachable; DEDICATED/ONPREM = process org). Not SHIPPED pool / AC-CLI-TENANT still 🟡.

Removed screens: `/executive` (merged into Home for owners), `/admin/catalog-favorites` (now a tab on `/admin/diagnostic-catalog`). Both routes deleted — no redirect.

**List UX (CLI-37):** `EraListFilterBar` = instant filters (no Apply; Reset inline; text search `useDebouncedValue` 300ms). Tables: name/title column first; row actions = Lucide icons + `TABLE_ROW_ICON_BTN_CLASS`. Home `/` full-width with one shared date for executive + ops.

`seesAll` = `canViewClinicAdmin || isPlatformSuperAdmin`. Nav is presentational; middleware + route guards remain authoritative.

